#3000
The Meditation Chamber~
   This solemn, simple room lies neary vacant, but for a few, simple wooden
benches.  Priests and monks come and go frequently, intent upon their humble
chores and prayers, some humming softly to themselves as they pass, wrapt in
meditation.  To the east arises the hustle and bustle of the Temple of the
Phoenix.  A short hallway extends to the north, bypassing several doorways
deeper within the temple.
~
