#3001
The Temple of the Phoenix~
   This lavish temple stands proudly, constructed from massive slabs of white
marble.  Ancient tapestries line the walls, each devoted to a single theme -
the coming of the Phoenix to Heliopolis.  Priests and monks pass, chanting
softly to themselves.  Worshippers make their way through the temple, moving
toward the altar to the north, the meditation chamber to the west, or the
temple forge to the east.  Southward a high, bronze gate marks the entrance.
Beyond the gates, fine marble steps descend to the temple plaza.
~
