#3002
The Clerics' Sanctum~
   This rather sparse room well befits the austere tenets of the al Guild of
Clerics.  Hard, wooden benches line the walls, where aspirants await training
by the High Priest.  A small altar stands at the northern end of the room,
where several clerics kneel in solemn worship.  A beautiful tapestry of the
Phoenix adorns the western wall.  The entrance to the Cleric's Guild lies to
the south.
~
