tapestry phoenix~
   This tapestry looks ancient.  It is nearly threadbare from exposure over the
years.  The tapestry shows a rendering of the Phoenix descending to the earth 
on wings of fire.  People on the ground are prostrate in worship of the 
mighty bird.
~
