#3003
Smoke Lane~
   The road continues its northerly path, through the flat plains and later
climbing into the the rocky foothills of the Eastern Mountains.  Whispering
pine trees line the sides road, their needles gently caressed by the wind.  
Though hard-packed, the dirt road churns up clouds of billowing dust as you
pass.  Awaying southward stand the high outer walls of Heliopolis.  This road
intersects another large road outside of the eastern gates of the city.
~
