#3004
The Entrance To The Clerics' Guild~
   This rather bare room, reflects the modesty of the clerical order.  The
room is furnished in a very sparse fashion, save for two hardwood benches
resting against the southern and western walls.  The open doorway to the north
leads to the inner sanctum of the guild, where the Guildmaster instructs
aspirants in the art of prayer and devotion to the gods.  The exit to the east
leads to the Temple Plaza.
~
