#3005
The Temple Plaza~
   The view from this locale is breathtaking.  To the north, wide, marble
stairs and a grand, bronze gate lead up to the grandiose monument, the Temple
of the Phoenix.  Streams of people flow endlessly across this central plaze,
making their way to and from the temple.  To the west lies the entrance to the
guild of clerics, while the Inn of the Flames lies to the east.  To the south,
the din of the Marketplace can be heard.
~
