#3006
The Entrance Hall of the Inn of the Flames~
   One of the oldest and most respected establishments on this continent, the
Inn of the Flames, is rivaled only by the Dancing Daemon Inn of New Thalos,
The entrance hall is warm and inviting, and many pegs line the walls for
patrons to hang their travelling cloaks and hoods.  The sound of hearty
laughter and the aroma of stout ale waft through the doorway to the east.  
The post office has taken up semi-permanent residence to the north, while a
small staircase leads upstairs to the inn's guest rooms.
~
