#3008
Smoke Lane~
   This narrow road, known to the natives as Smoke Lane, meanders northward
across a low, rolling plain dotted with trees, until it reaches the rugged
foothills of the Eastern Mountains.  Gentle hills rise just beyond, marking
the start of the mountain range.  A breeze rustles up some dust from the dry,
dirt road.  To the south, this road intersects with a more substantial
east-west road.
~
