#3009
Atlon's Fine Breads~
   Atlon's breads have a fine reputation throughout the region for superior
quality and excellent taste.  The tempting aroma of fresh-baked breads and
pastries fills this small shop.  A wide counter seperates the bakery from the
storefront, a fine dusting of flour blanketing nearly every surface.  Warm
baked goods fill the shelves behind the counter, offering a good view of
today's offerings.
