#3010
Trin's General Store~
   Well known throughout the realms as a buyer of fine goods and retailer of
the highest quality merchandise, Trin's store reflects that attitude.  Well
kept, with a large carpet covering the central area, row upon row of shelves
display all manner of merchandise.  Lanterns, rope, and other common items
filling every corner of the room, the inventory includes even some rather
unusual items which seem more for display than utility.  In one corner, a
narrow stairway leads upward, a small sign proclaiming 'Mira's Clothing'.
~
