#3011
Reteo's Fine Weapons~
   Within this small shop, Reteo offers for sale the simple product of his
humble craft, as well as such items as he can afford to buy from adventurers.
Aside from the occasional showy piece, short swords, daggers, and maces make
up the bulk of the inventory.  The quality of Reteo's craftmanship is crude
and common, but his weapons are serviceable enough.  Many adventurers have
fond memories of their first weapons, obtained in this very shop.  The
southern doorway opens onto East High Street.
~
