West High Street~
   Here, at the westernmost end of High Street stands the city gate, where
High Street extends eastward toward the town Marketplace.  A simple shop
stands just alongside the roadway to the north, a large, hastily painted sign
declaring it Madoal's Magic Shop.  To the south rises a large scholarly
looking building - The Mages Guild.  People pass by quickly as they scurry to
and fro on their errands.
