#3013
West High Street~
   Travelling along West High Street, the main street of Heliopolis, the
citizens of this fine town go about their daily affairs.  Directly to the east
rises the hustle and bustle of The Marketplace, Heliopolis' main square.  
Here, people mill about, visiting the small shops lining the avenue.  Above
opposing doorways, signs proclaim Geofrec's Armory to the south, and Atlon's
Fine Breads to the north.  The roadway extends to the east and west.
