#3018
An Intersection of Roads~
   The roadway intersects a smaller byway, allowing easy travel to the north.
The northern road, known to the locals as Smoke Lane, passes through the
windswept plains, winding its way toward the craggy peaks of the Eastern
Mountains.  Westward, along the main road, rises a fine city, the muted din of
city commotion barely reaching your ears from this distance.  To the east, the
roadway rises and falls as it climbs the foothills of the Eastern Mountains.
~
