#3019
The Inner Sanctum~
   Within the Inner Sanctum of the Mage's Guild students of the magical arts
come to practice with the High Wizard.  The granite walls and floor lie
scortched by the soot of failed experiments and spells gone awry.  Dark
pentagrams and other symbols of ancient power lie partially obscured on the
floor, a buildup of waxy residue in several places indicating where candles
are generally placed.  The only intact objects in this room are the contents
of the bookshelves.  The Master must have cast ward spells upon the books to
prevent damage by inept students or angry demons.
~
