Geofrec's Armors~
   Nearly every bit of and wallspace is covered in a wide array of various
armors.  Full suits of matching armor stand on display, while huge tower
shields hang from the walls.  Helmets, gauntlets, and other accessories line
the shelves which ring the entire shop.  The clang of steel on steel rings
loudly from behind the shop.  Through the casement window to the north, West
High Street passes through the heart of town.  A simple sign hangs against the
counter.
~
