#3021
Entrance to the Warrior's Guild~
   This grand hall is hung in splendid tapapestries depicting great battles
between the warriors of Heliopolis and the forces of the Underdark.  Crossed
broadswords, suspended above a splendid archway in the southern wall, mark the
entryway to a noisy practice arena.  The shouts of the fencing master rise
above the din of swordplay, and the curses of opponents.  East High Street
lies through the doorway to the north.
