#3022
Before Heliopolis~
   You stand at the outskirts of Heliopolis, capital of Caledon, and the
highest city in the realms.  To the west, the roadway passes through the great
eastern gates, and onto the main street of the city.  A confusion of shops,
pubs, and open-air marketplaces crowd the broad thoroughfare.  Off to the
east, a wide lane passes through the foothills toward the nearby city of
Sundhaven, Heliopolis' closest neighbor.
