arena where trained warriors work to hone their fighting skills.  The clash of
sword upon shield nearly obscures the shouted orders of the master, of sword.
All is presided over by the warrior guildmaster who surveys the scene from
this platform, high above the arena floor.  It appears that anyone could be
easily paired with a sparring partner to practice their skills.
