East Ash Street~
   Only small groups of people roam the street in this area, where the
frenzied activity of Meeting Square is absent.  The proximity to the city
docks has thinned the crowds, and attracted individuals of entirely the wrong
element.  Delapidated warehouses line both sides of the street, where dock
workers move cargo to and from ships moored on the river.  Trade goods are
shipped to Heliopolis from throughout the realms.
