The Back Room~
   This small room appears to be used for small gatherings.  A single, old
table rests in the center of the room, surrounded by several well-worn chairs.
There are no windows in the dark-stained walls, the only light provided by a
greasy lantern suspended above the tabletop.  The single light source causes
ghostly shadows to dance about, making it difficult to see clearly in the
ominous darkness of the room.
~
