A Small Clearing~
   A crackling campfire dominates this small clearing, blazing brightly with
yellow flames tinged with blue and white.  A crude tent of old and tattered
cloth is situated alongside the fire, and animal hides hang from nearby trees,
suspended to dry on hempen ropes.  This primitive lifestyle is common to the
simple-minded barbarians of Caledon.
