The City Dump~
   An overwhelming stench assaults your senses from the great midden heaps
that fill the town dump.  All manner of refuse lies piled within the mounds of
filth, including food, scrap metal and lumber, and wads of mouldering paper.
A high fence surrounds the area, preventing creatures like dogs and racoons
from infesting the place.  At the very center, a small patch of earth has been
cleared away, exposing a wide, metal grate.
