west, a smaller trail branches off the main pathway, leading north into open
grasslands, and off toward the Dragonhelm mountains.  The mountains command
the view to the north, their majestic snow-capped peaks reaching toward the
heavens.  The view to the east is dominated by the low, rolling hills of the
Eastern Mountains.
