high turrets of the castle to the north.  Still a wide and busy thoroughfare,
shops line the western side of the street.  A large sign in a storefront
proclaims the Heliopolis Cartographer's Guild.  A wide swath of grass lines
the eastern side of the road beneath the city wall.  People enjoy the relative
peace of the setting, while traffic flows by.
~
