The Path Through the Fields~
   The elevation gradually changes as the path makes its way through the
fields and up into the awe-inspiring mountain range to the north.  Hills swell
upward to meet the Dragonhelms, rising and falling as the foothills merges
with the grassy fields.  Clusters of trees and brush perch atop some of the
higher hilltops, others remaining barren and rocky.  Deer graze in the
distance, keeping a watchful eye for predators.
