The Dusty Trail Along the North Wall~
   Scorch marks dot the rough, stone walls that separate the city of
Heliopolis from the northern wilderness.  Remnants of the last invasion
attempt on Heliopolis led by a reclusive wizard from the Dragonhelms, the
citizens of Heliopolis have decided to leave the markings as a constant
reminder of what might happen if they do not remain vigilant.
